---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="Optimizing Production Timelines: Lead Time Strategy for Activewear Brands"
  description="Learn how to manage seasonal demand and optimize production cycles with Fitclo's data-driven lead time management for high-volume orders."
>
  <article class="py-32 max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 font-['Century_Gothic',sans-serif]">
    <header class="mb-16">
      <span class="text-accent font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-sm">Supply Chain Efficiency</span>
      <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-black uppercase tracking-tighter mt-4 mb-8 font-['Montserrat',sans-serif]">Mastering Lead Times: <span class="text-accent italic">Seasonal Production Planning</span></h2>
      <div class="flex items-center space-x-4 text-gray-500 text-sm">
        <span>Published: June 20, 2026</span>
        <span>•</span>
        <span>11 Min Read</span>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
      <p class="text-xl text-black font-bold mb-8">Missing a seasonal launch by just two weeks can cost a retailer 30% of their projected revenue. For $30k+ buyers, lead time isn't just a number—it's a critical financial KPI.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-black uppercase mt-12 mb-6 font-['Montserrat',sans-serif]">1. The "Peak Season" Paradox</h2>
      <p>During peak production months (September–January), most factories over-commit, leading to "lead time creep." At Fitclo, we reserve 30% of our capacity exclusively for long-term partners, ensuring that your high-volume orders are protected from seasonal congestion.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-black uppercase mt-12 mb-6 font-['Montserrat',sans-serif]">2. Synchronized Supply Chain Management</h2>
      <p>Our lead time optimization begins at the fabric mill. By utilizing our **Vertical Integration model**, we align fabric dyeing cycles directly with sewing slot availability. This reduces the "idle time" between production stages, often cutting standard lead times by 10-15 days for high-volume clients.</p>

      <div class="bg-gray-100 p-8 rounded-3xl my-8">
        <h4 class="font-bold text-black mb-4 uppercase text-xs">Typical B2B Lead Time Roadmap:</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-4">
          <li class="flex items-center"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-[#C9A84C] rounded-full mr-3"></span> **Design & Tech Pack Audit:** 48 Hours</li>
          <li class="flex items-center"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-[#C9A84C] rounded-full mr-3"></span> **Sampling Phase:** 7-10 Days</li>
          <li class="flex items-center"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-[#C9A84C] rounded-full mr-3"></span> **Bulk Production:** 30-45 Days (Capacity Reserved)</li>
          <li class="flex items-center"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-[#C9A84C] rounded-full mr-3"></span> **QC & Packing:** 3-5 Days</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-black uppercase mt-12 mb-6 font-['Montserrat',sans-serif]">3. Inventory Buffering</h2>
      <p>For our $25k+ monthly partners, we offer **Inventory Buffering**. We keep raw fabric stock ready for your best-selling styles, allowing us to drop-ship repeat orders within 21 days rather than the standard 45. This "Rapid Refill" capability is essential for managing viral growth and retail spikes.</p>
    </div>

    <footer class="mt-20 pt-10 border-t border-gray-100">
      <div class="bg-black text-white p-12 rounded-[40px] text-center">
        <h3 class="text-3xl font-black uppercase tracking-tighter mb-6">Plan Your Next Launch</h3>
        <p class="mb-8 text-white/70">Request our current production schedule and lock in your delivery slots for 2026/27.</p>
        <a href="/contact" class="inline-block bg-accent text-black px-10 py-4 rounded-full font-black uppercase tracking-widest hover:scale-105 transition-transform">Get Production Schedule</a>
      </div>
    </footer>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
